  {
    "speaker": "女子高生モデル",
    "text": "──ねぇ、雛菜って\r\nトールと元々知り合いなの？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0220",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003030010,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "……へ～？\r\n違いますけど……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "023",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102300303/1023003030010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "女子高生モデル",
    "text": "そうなんだ\r\nトールから話しかけてたから、知り合いなのかと思った",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003030020,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "なんか、同じアイドルだから？\r\nとか言ってましたよ～",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300303/1023003030020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "女子高生モデル",
    "text": "……そっか\r\nあのさ…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003030030,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300303/1023003030030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "女子高生モデル",
    "text": "もし、トールに興味無いなら\r\n協力してくれないかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003030040,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "へ～、それって……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300303/1023003030040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "女子高生モデル",
    "text": "私、前にトールと共演したことがあって\r\n……その時から気になってたんだけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "女子高生モデル",
    "text": "お互いに、こういう仕事してるし\r\n諦めてたの",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "女子高生モデル",
    "text": "でも、この番組の話が来て、\r\nそこにトールの名前があったから……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "女子高生モデル",
    "text": "私はこの番組に出るって、決めたの\r\n…………このことは、事務所にも言ってない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003030050,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "…………\r\n……そうなんですね～……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300303/1023003030050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003030060,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ん～、でも\r\n雛菜って、何をしたらいいですか？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300303/1023003030060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "女子高生モデル",
    "text": "え……？\r\n何って、だから協力を──……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003030070,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "今言ったこと、雛菜に言うんじゃなくて\r\nただ本人に言えばいいんじゃないかなって",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300303/1023003030070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "女子高生モデル",
    "text": "それは……そうかもしれないけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023003030080,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300303/1023003030080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "女子高生モデル",
    "text": "……もういい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textFrame": "off",
